    <string name="cd_info">More information</string>
    <string name="time_limit_info_title">How Free / Lock / Break work</string>
    <string name="time_limit_info_body">Your session runs in a repeating cycle:\n\n• Free — your restricted apps are usable for the number of minutes you set here. This only happens once, right when you tap Start.\n\n• Lock — after Free time runs out, restricted apps are blocked for the Lock duration.\n\n• Break — after each Lock, you get a short Break window (this duration, not Free time) before it locks again. Break repeats with Lock for as long as the session runs.\n\nThis follows real elapsed time even if you never open the app during a Lock or Break window — leaving it alone doesn\'t restart, extend, or skip anything.</string>
